      "content": "Jun 30, 2026 · The Easy Access Rules for Unmanned Aircraft Systems (EAR for UAS) contain the rules and procedures for the operation of unmanned aircraft, displayed in a consolidated, easy-to-read format, with advanced navigation features through links and bookmarks."
    },
    {
      "title": "Drones & Air Mobility - Related Easy Access Rules | EASA",
      "url": "https://www.easa.europa.eu/en/domains/civil-drones/easy-access-rules",
